{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>Peleg, for in his days the earth was divided.</b> He indicates the distinction of <b>Ever</b>, who through the holy spirit foresaw what was then destined to come about in the days of his son, and named his son Peleg to disclose the cause of the shortening of human lifespans from Peleg onward. For indeed the cause of this was the sin of the men of the Dispersion and their punishment, which corrupted their temperament through the sudden change of air."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:29:45.149890237Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}